{
  "formId": "apply-for-funeral-embalmer-licence",
  "title": "Apply to Environmental Health for an Embalmer Licence",
  "description": "Use this service to apply for an embalmer licence.",
  "processors": [
    {
      "type": "email",
      "config": {
        "recipientField": "personal-details.email",
        "subject": "Your embalmer licence application has been received"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "email",
      "config": {
        "recipientField": "catchment.mdaEmail",
        "subject": "A new embalmer licence application has been received"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "method": "POST",
        "signatureHeader": "X-Webhook-Signature",
        "mapping": {
          "programmeCode": "FUNERAL_EMBALMER_LICENCE",
          "mdaCode": "MOH",
          "programmeShortCode": "FEL",
          "applicant": {
            "name": [
              "personal-details.first-name",
              "personal-details.last-name"
            ],
            "email": "personal-details.email",
            "phone": "personal-details.phone-number"
          },
          "excludeSteps": [
            "check-your-answers",
            "declaration",
            "submission-confirmation"
          ],
          "groupByStep": true
        },
        "timeoutMs": 10000
      }
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "visibility": "preview"
  },
  "catchmentRouting": {
    "coordinatesField": "personal-details.address-coordinates",
    "parishField": "personal-details.home-parish"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "stepId": "personal-details",
      "title": "Tell us about yourself",
      "elements": [
        {
          "ref": "components/first-name",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "first-name",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Enter your first name",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/middle-name",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "middle-name",
            "label": "Middle name or names",
            "hint": "Enter all middle names in order."
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/last-name",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "last-name",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Enter your last name",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/address-lookup",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "address-line-1",
            "label": "Address line 1",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Enter your address",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            "geocodeTargets": {
              "line2FieldId": "address-line-2",
              "parishFieldId": "home-parish",
              "coordinatesFieldId": "address-coordinates"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/address",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "address-line-2",
            "label": "Address line 2",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": false
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/parish",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "home-parish",
            "label": "Parish",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Select your parish",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/generic-text",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "address-coordinates",
            "label": "Home address coordinates",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": false
              }
            },
            "ui": {
              "hidden": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/email",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "email",
            "label": "What is your email address?",
            "hint": "We will use this to contact you about your application.",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Enter your email address",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/telephone",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "phone-number",
            "label": "What is your phone number?",
            "hint": "You can enter a Barbados or international number.",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Enter your phone number",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "behaviours": []
    },
    {
      "stepId": "workplace-details",
      "title": "Tell us where you plan to work",
      "elements": [
        {
          "ref": "components/generic-checkbox",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "workplace-locations",
            "label": "Where do you plan to work as an embalmer?",
            "hint": "Select all that apply.",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "Select at least one workplace option",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "At a funeral establishment",
                "value": "one-funeral-establishment"
              },
              {
                "label": "At multiple funeral establishments",
                "value": "multiple-establishments"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/generic-text",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "funeral-establishment-name",
            "label": "What is the name of the funeral establishment?",
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "fieldConditionalOn",
                "targetFieldId": "workplace-locations",
                "operator": "in",
                "value": [
                  "one-funeral-establishment"
                ],
                "targetStepId": "workplace-details"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/address",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "funeral-establishment-address-line-1",
            "label": "Address line 1",
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "fieldConditionalOn",
                "targetFieldId": "workplace-locations",
                "operator": "in",
                "value": [
                  "one-funeral-establishment"
                ],
                "targetStepId": "workplace-details"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/address",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "funeral-establishment-address-line-2",
            "label": "Address line 2",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": false
              }
            },
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "fieldConditionalOn",
                "targetFieldId": "workplace-locations",
                "operator": "in",
                "value": [
                  "one-funeral-establishment"
                ],
                "targetStepId": "workplace-details"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/parish",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "funeral-establishment-parish",
            "label": "Parish",
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "fieldConditionalOn",
                "targetFieldId": "workplace-locations",
                "operator": "in",
                "value": [
                  "one-funeral-establishment"
                ],
                "targetStepId": "workplace-details"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "behaviours": []
    },
    {
      "stepId": "documents",
      "title": "Add your documents",
      "elements": [
        {
          "ref": "components/upload-document",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "passport-photo",
            "label": "Upload your passport-size photographs.",
            "hint": "These photographs should have been taken recently.",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": true
              },
              "fileTypes": {
                "error": "Upload a passport-size photograph in JPEG, PNG or GIF format",
                "value": [
                  "image/jpeg",
                  "image/png",
                  "image/gif"
                ]
              },
              "itemMaxSize": {
                "error": "File must be 5 MB or smaller",
                "value": 5242880
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/upload-document",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "embalmer-qualification",
            "label": "Upload your embalmer qualification",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": true,
                "error": "Upload your embalmer qualification, or use a reference letter instead"
              },
              "fileTypes": {
                "value": [
                  "application/pdf",
                  "image/jpeg",
                  "image/png"
                ],
                "error": "Upload your embalmer qualification in PDF, JPEG or PNG format"
              },
              "itemMaxSize": {
                "value": 5242880,
                "error": "File must be 5 MB or smaller"
              }
            },
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "optionalIf",
                "targetStepId": "documents",
                "targetFieldId": "use-reference-letter",
                "operator": "equal",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/show-hide",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "use-reference-letter",
            "label": "Use reference letter instead"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "components/upload-document",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "embalmer-evidence",
            "label": "Upload letter of embalmer work experience",
            "hint": "If you have been engaged in the practice of embalming, prior to the regulations coming into effect in 1984, you will need to evidence you have been practicing for a period of more than five (5) years, or have worked under the direct supervision of an approved embalmer for more than three (3) years.",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "value": true,
                "error": "Upload your letter of embalmer work experience"
              },
              "fileTypes": {
                "value": [
                  "application/pdf",
                  "image/jpeg",
                  "image/png"
                ],
                "error": "Upload your letter of embalmer work experience in PDF, JPEG or PNG format"
              },
              "itemMaxSize": {
                "value": 5242880,
                "error": "File must be 5 MB or smaller"
              }
            },
            "behaviours": [
              {
                "type": "fieldConditionalOn",
                "targetStepId": "documents",
                "targetFieldId": "use-reference-letter",
                "operator": "equal",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "behaviours": []
    },
    {
      "stepId": "check-your-answers",
      "title": "Check your answers",
      "elements": [],
      "behaviours": []
    },
    {
      "stepId": "declaration",
      "title": "Confirm and submit your application",
      "elements": [
        {
          "ref": "components/confirmation",
          "overrides": {
            "fieldId": "declaration-confirmed",
            "label": "Declaration",
            "validations": {
              "required": {
                "error": "You must confirm the declaration to continue",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "I confirm that the information in this application is true and correct to the best of my knowledge.",
                "value": "confirmed"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "behaviours": []
    },
    {
      "stepId": "submission-confirmation",
      "title": "Application submitted",
      "elements": [],
      "behaviours": [],
      "markdownContent": "A copy of your request has been sent to the email address you gave and to the Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}**.\n\n## What happens next\n\n- Your application goes to the Environmental Health Service associated with your location. If additional information or documentation is required, you will be contacted by an Environmental Health Officer.\n\n**Obtaining your licence:**\n\n- If your application is approved, you will receive a confirmation email and the Environmental Health Office will mail your licence. In addition, you can also request to collect it from your assigned polyclinic.\n\n## Contact\n\nIf you need help, contact the relevant Environmental Health Service office.\n\n- Branford Taitt Polyclinic - [536-3700](tel:+12465363700), [EHD.BTPC@health.gov.bb](mailto:EHD.BTPC@health.gov.bb)\n- David Thompson Health and Social Services Complex - [536-4453](tel:+12465364453), [DTHSSC.EHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:DTHSSC.EHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Eunice Gibson Polyclinic - [536-4033](tel:+12465364033), [EuniceGibsonEHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:EuniceGibsonEHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Maurice Byer Polyclinic - [536-3214](tel:+12465363214), [MBPC.apps@health.gov.bb](mailto:MBPC.apps@health.gov.bb)\n- Randall Phillips Polyclinic - [536-4338](tel:+12465364338), [RPPC.EHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:RPPC.EHD@health.gov.bb)\n- St. Phillip Polyclinic - [536-1240](tel:+12465361240), [StPhilipEHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:StPhilipEHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Winston Scott Polyclinic - [536-3476](tel:+12465363476), [EHD.WSPC@health.gov.bb](mailto:EHD.WSPC@health.gov.bb)"
    }
  ],
  "createdAt": "2026-08-25T14:05:29.888Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z"
}
